{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model using the scvi_n200 encoder with avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275. The results suggest the scvi_n200 encoder may improve performance compared to previous RNA encoders like pca_n2000, but the exact contribution of the encoder choice remains uncertain without direct comparison to other encoders. The multiprofile setting's benefit is confirmed, but the role of aggregation methods or fusion strategies in this context is not yet evaluated."
}

